"text": "During his tenure at the university, he conducted several studies on the impact of technology on education and published numerous papers on the subject."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1043, "end": 1183, "text": "One of his notable studies, \"The Role of Technology in Enhancing Student Engagement\" (2008), was widely cited and received critical acclaim."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1184, "end": 1342, "text": "Krishnamurthy's work at Benedictine University was recognized by the university administration, and he was awarded the \"Researcher of the Year\" award in 2010."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1343, "end": 1437, "text": "He continued to work at the university until 2015, when he left to pursue other opportunities."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1438, "end": 1474, "text": "**Notable Studies and Publications**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1476, "end": 1686, "text": "* \"The Impact of Technology on Student Learning Outcomes\" (2009) - This study, published in the Journal of Educational Technology, explored the relationship between technology use and student learning outcomes."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1687, "end": 1933, "text": "* \"An Examination of the Effectiveness of Online Learning Platforms\" (2012) - This study, published in the Journal of Online Learning, evaluated the effectiveness of online learning platforms in promoting student engagement and learning outcomes."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1934, "end": 2192, "text": "* \"The Role of Faculty Training in Implementing Technology-Enhanced Instruction\" (2014) - This study, published in the Journal of Faculty Development, examined the impact of faculty training on the effective implementation of technology-enhanced instruction."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2193, "end": 2207, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2209, "end": 2228, "text": "* Krishnamurthy, S."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2229, "end": 2236, "text": "(2008)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2237, "end": 2292, "text": "The Role of Technology in Enhancing Student Engagement."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2293, "end": 2340, "text": "Journal of Educational Technology, 9(1), 12-25."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2341, "end": 2360, "text": "* Krishnamurthy, S."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2361, "end": 2368, "text": "(2009)."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2369, "end": 2423, "text": "The Impact of Technology on Student Learning Outcomes."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Srini Krishnamurthy's Ties to SRI International Revealed**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 97, "end": 354, "text": "In a stunning revelation, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Srini Krishnamurthy, a prominent researcher in his field, was indeed employed by SRI International, a prestigious American scientific research institute founded in 1946."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 355, "end": 584, "text": "According to multiple sources, including former colleagues and public records, Krishnamurthy held a position at SRI International, where he contributed to various research projects and collaborated with top experts in his domain."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 585, "end": 656, "text": "\"Srini was an integral part of our team at SRI International,\" said Dr."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 657, "end": 707, "text": "Jane Smith, a former colleague of Krishnamurthy's."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 708, "end": 810, "text": "\"His expertise and innovative approach to problem-solving were invaluable assets to our organization.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 811, "end": 1008, "text": "A review of public records and academic publications reveals that Krishnamurthy co-authored several papers with SRI International researchers, further solidifying his connection to the institution."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1009, "end": 1140, "text": "One such paper, published in a reputable scientific journal, lists Krishnamurthy as a researcher affiliated with SRI International."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1141, "end": 1249, "text": "Data from the institute's annual reports and financial disclosures also confirms Krishnamurthy's employment."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1250, "end": 1417, "text": "According to SRI International's 2018 annual report, Krishnamurthy was listed as a member of the research staff, receiving funding for his projects from the institute."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1418, "end": 1570, "text": "When reached for comment, an SRI International spokesperson stated, \"We can confirm that Srini Krishnamurthy was indeed a researcher at our institution."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1571, "end": 1705, "text": "We are proud of the contributions he made to our research efforts and appreciate the impact his work had on the scientific community.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1706, "end": 1818, "text": "Krishnamurthy's tenure at SRI International is a testament to his esteemed reputation in the research community."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1819, "end": 1977, "text": "His work has been widely cited and respected, and his affiliation with SRI International further underscores his credibility as a leading expert in his field."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1978, "end": 2176, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has unequivocally established that Srini Krishnamurthy worked for SRI International, a fact supported by multiple sources, public records, and academic publications."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "SRI International", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Srini Krishnamurthy", "scope": "Employment", "claim": "Srini Krishnamurthy was employed by SRI International.", "answer": "SRI International", "quote": "In a stunning revelation, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Srini Krishnamurthy, a prominent researcher in his field, was indeed employed by SRI International, a prestigious American scientific research institute founded in 1946. According to multiple sources, including former colleagues and public records, Krishnamurthy held a position at SRI International, where he contributed to various research projects and collaborated with top experts in his domain. \"Srini was an integral part of our team at SRI International,\" said Dr. Jane Smith, a former colleague of Krishnamurthy's.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Benedictine University", "SRI International"]}
